      "id": "05-01",
      "title": "Which route should this packet take?",
      "chapter": "The routing puzzle",
      "duration": 21.6,
      "narration": "Which route should this packet take? The path with fewer links looks promising, but the costs tell a different story. Let's follow how a router can discover a better answer, then adapt when that answer breaks.",
      "bullets": [
        "One destination, several paths",
        "Best depends on the metric"
