    {
      "id": "05-03",
      "title": "Add costs, not just hops",
      "chapter": "The routing puzzle",
      "duration": 21.166666666666668,
      "narration": "A-B-D-F has three links and costs fifteen. A-C-B-D-E-F has five links and costs thirteen. More steps, lower total. The drawing's apparent shortcut loses as soon as we add the numbers along both complete paths.",
      "bullets": [
